<section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-20">
  <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-text-heading text-center">
    Perguntas frequentes
  </h2>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-12 space-y-4">
    <details class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-5 group">
      <summary class="font-semibold text-text-heading cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
        O app funciona sem internet?
        <span class="text-primary text-lg group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform">+</span>
      </summary>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mt-3 leading-relaxed">
        Sim. O MentAll &eacute; um aplicativo nativo Android que armazena todos os dados
        localmente no dispositivo. A internet s&oacute; &eacute; necess&aacute;ria para
        transcri&ccedil;&atilde;o de &aacute;udio e s&iacute;ntese por IA.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-5 group">
      <summary class="font-semibold text-text-heading cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
        Quais abordagens cl&iacute;nicas s&atilde;o suportadas?
        <span class="text-primary text-lg group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform">+</span>
      </summary>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mt-3 leading-relaxed">
        14 abordagens: TCC, Psican&aacute;lise, Psicodin&acirc;mica, Humanista,
        Fenomenol&oacute;gico-existencial, Logoterapia, Gestalt-terapia, Sist&ecirc;mica,
        ACT, DBT, Terapia do Esquema, An&aacute;lise do Comportamento, Integrativa e Outra.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-5 group">
      <summary class="font-semibold text-text-heading cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
        Como funciona o pacote de sess&otilde;es?
        <span class="text-primary text-lg group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform">+</span>
      </summary>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mt-3 leading-relaxed">
        Voc&ecirc; cria um pacote com N sess&otilde;es e valor total. A cada sess&atilde;o
        registrada, o sistema desconta automaticamente do pacote. O paciente v&ecirc;
        quantas sess&otilde;es restam.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-5 group">
      <summary class="font-semibold text-text-heading cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
        Meus dados est&atilde;o seguros?
        <span class="text-primary text-lg group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform">+</span>
      </summary>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mt-3 leading-relaxed">
        Sim. Tudo &eacute; criptografado com AES-256 e protegido por PIN.
        Dados s&oacute; saem do dispositivo quando voc&ecirc; solicita transcri&ccedil;&atilde;o
        ou s&iacute;ntese por IA, e mesmo assim s&atilde;o pseudonimizados.
      </p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
